MIT License

Applies to the SPECIFICATION DOCUMENTS in this directory, and to nothing else.

WHY THIS DIRECTORY IS DIFFERENT (ADR-011). The repository is licensed under
PolyForm Shield 1.0.0, whose noncompete protects the client and the services built
with it. That protection would defeat the purpose of a specification: the
DataModel standard described here is worth nothing unless OTHER implementations
read it and run against it, and a noncompete over a standard is a standard nobody
can adopt.

Roblox made the same split -- Luau is MIT while the client and the platform are
not.

The conformance cases that verify this specification live in the Aether
repository and are MIT there.

